    <Requirement id="ER-P015-01-02" level="1" requirementType="parameter">
      <sysml:Name>冷却水系统报警与保护功能</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水低压报警应触发备用泵自动切换，若双泵均失效则应自动减速。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P015" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-LDR-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>低压时无备用泵切换或减速保护可能导致主机冷却中断。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟低压条件，确认备用泵自动启动并切换，切换时间按项目调试大纲确认。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>模拟双泵失效，确认自动减速逻辑正确执行。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【冷却水系统报警与保护功能】，来自原始需求「低压」。E-SUPP-LDR-001 支撑了低压报警触发备用泵自动切换及双泵失效自动减速的逻辑。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
